    <string name="suppress_vm_label">Hide voicemail alerts after blocked calls</string>
    <string name="suppress_vm_help">After a blocked call, mutes voicemail alerts until a VM looks like it came from a contact/allowed number (or a non-blocked caller rang more recently). Not a 15‑minute timer. Does not delete voicemails. Requires Notification access.</string>
